OL,3,ABriton fighting for Russia killed in
OL,4,AUkraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British national has been killed in
OL,7,FUkraine while fighting for Russia.
OL,9,FBradley Townsend is said to have died
OL,10,Ffollowing an attack by a
OL,11,Fremote-controlled FPV drone in
OL,12,FUkraine's eastern Donetsk region. His
OL,13,Fdeath, on 10 June, is believed to be
OL,14,Fthe first of a British citizen fighting
OL,15,Ffor Russia in the conflict.
OL,17,FThe 33-year-old left his home in
OL,18,FBarnsley, South Yorkshire, earlier this
OL,19,Fyear after telling his family he was
OL,20,Fgoing to Romania, according to the
OL,21,FYorkshire Post.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
