OL,3,ABriton fighting for Russia killed in
OL,4,AUkraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Foreign, Commonwealth & Development
OL,7,FOffice (FCDO) confirmed it was aware of
OL,8,Freports a British national had died in
OL,9,FUkraine, adding it was in contact with
OL,10,Fhis family.
